---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const postdocs = [
  'Gretsen Velezmoro Jáuregui',
  'Nikita Arnst',
  'Raphaël Bodin',
  'Chariklea Peta',
];
---

<Layout title="People · ITNRI" description="Principal investigators and postdoctoral researchers at ITNRI.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">People</h1>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Principal Investigators</h2>

  <article class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 dark:border-neutral-800">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Vladimir Parpura, MD, PhD</h3>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-500">
      Distinguished Professor and Director, ITNRI · MAE, MSASA, FAAS, FAPS
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
      Vladimir Parpura holds a medical degree from the University of Zagreb, Croatia (1989)
      and a doctorate in Neuroscience and Zoology from Iowa State University (1993). He has
      held faculty appointments at Iowa State University, the University of California
      Riverside, the University of Rijeka, Croatia, and the University of Alabama at
      Birmingham, USA. He is presently Distinguished Professor and Director of ITNRI at
      Zhejiang Chinese Medical University, Hangzhou, China, and a Cheung Kong Scholar and
      Kun Peng Action Expert.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
      He discovered the astrocyte–neuron glutamate-mediated signalling pathway — gliotransmission —
      which led to the concept of the tripartite synapse. Gliotransmission has since proven
      important for sleep, respiration, learning, memory, gut motility and secretion. Since
      2021 he has ranked number 2 in the world in astrocyte expertise (expertscape.com).
      Based on Google Scholar, his H-index is 82, with over 32,000 citations (as given in his CV).
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
      <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&user=ekvKLtMAAAAJ">Google Scholar profile →</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-neutral-400">·</span>
      <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/?term=Parpura+V">Publications on PubMed →</a>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-500">
      Honours include membership of Academia Europaea (2012), the Dana Alliance for Brain
      Initiatives (2016), the Slovenian Academy of Sciences and Arts (2017), Fellowship of
      the American Association for the Advancement of Science (2017) and Fellowship of the
      American Physiological Society (2020), and the 2025 Mayo Clinic Distinguished Alumnus Award.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 dark:border-neutral-800">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Vedrana Montana Parpura</h3>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-500">Principal Investigator, ITNRI</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-500">Biography to be added.</p>
  </article>

  <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold">Postdoctoral Researchers</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
    Four postdoctoral researchers. Biographies to be added.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    {
      postdocs.map((name) => (
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 p-5 dark:border-neutral-800">
          <h3 class="font-bold">{name}</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-500">Postdoctoral Researcher, ITNRI</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-500">Biography to be added.</p>
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</Layout>
